data: {"type":"CUSTOM","name":"on_interrupt","value":{"id":"9ee6b612c05bbfb90e08abdbe4c0f903","reason":"human_input","metadata":{"kind":"ask_user_question","steps":[{"id":"plugin-development-decision","question":"是否按此方案开发？","description":"目标: 把 Agent 返回的 CUSTOM 事件 app.sales.report（value.format=\"json\"，value.payload 为 JSON 字符串）在聊天消息里渲染成销售报表：显示表头 title、月份表、按收入排序按钮、点击某一行显示该月订单数量；payload 非法时安全降级提示，不抛错。\n\n目标插件与位置: sales-report-message\n\n需要新增的能力: app.sales.report 事件的报表表格渲染; 按收入排序（升序/降序切换）; 点击行显示该月订单数量; payload JSON 字符串安全解析与校验\n\napplication 级数据消息渲染器实例，与其他数据消息插件并列（context-retrieval-message 之后）","options":[{"id":"start","label":"开始开发"},{"id":"adjust","label":"调整需求"},{"id":"defer","label":"暂不处理"}],"selectionMode":"single","minSelections":1,"maxSelections":1}]}}}

